===Noun===
'''knoop''' {{m}} (Plural: [[knopen]], diminutive: [[knoopje]])

# a [[knot]] (i.e. a [[loop]] of string or any other long flexible material which cannot be untied without pulling part of the string through the loops)
#:''ik zit in de knoop'' &mdash; I'm in a hard spot: I'm all tied up.
# {{context|nautical|lang=nl}} a [[knot]] (i.e. a unit of [[velocity]], corresponding to traveling a distance of 1 [[nautical mile]] per [[hour]])

also, another name for a buttn, knoop is the family name given to the makers of buttons.

